{"corpus":"ccc","number":2636,"text_html":"<span>Les premières communautés chrétiennes ont vécu intensément cette forme de partage <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>. L’Apôtre Paul les fait participer ainsi à son ministère de l’Évangile <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"5\">2</sup>, mais il intercède aussi pour elles <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">3</sup>. L’intercession des chrétiens ne connaît pas de frontières : « pour tous les hommes<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§1900</sup>, pour les dépositaires de l’autorité » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"11\">4</sup>, pour ceux qui persécutent <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"12\">5</sup>, pour le salut<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§1037</sup> de ceux qui repoussent l’Évangile <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"13\">6</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["1900","1037"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Ac 12:5"},{"text":"Ac 20:36"},{"text":"Ac 21:5"},{"text":"2 Co 9:14"},{"text":"Ep 6:18-20"},{"text":"Col 4:3-4"},{"text":"1 Th 5:25"},{"text":"2 Th 1:11"},{"text":"Col 1:3"},{"text":"Ph 1:3-4"},{"text":"1 Tm 2:1"},{"text":"Rm 12:14"},{"text":"Rm 10:1"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ac 12:5","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"20:36","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"21:5","idx":3,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"2 Co 9:14","idx":4,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ep 6:18-20","idx":5,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Col 4:3-4","idx":6,"marker_idx":5,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"1 Th 5:25","idx":7,"marker_idx":5,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir 2 Th 1:11","idx":8,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Col 1:3","idx":9,"marker_idx":8,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ph 1:3-4","idx":10,"marker_idx":8,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"1 Tm 2:1","idx":11,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"